  AuthorImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 21a913691ae1adb4a8675e1c62d7a081, type: 3}
  authorName: Pete van Norman
  publishDate: February 15, 2068
  HeadlineText: House burned down due to the fire fighters being out of water
  detailsText: A family has lost their home after a serious fire broke out in their house. Firefighters arrived quickly, but unfortunately, they did not have enough water to put out the flames.   Due to the ongoing water shortage, the emergency services struggled to get the water they needed. The fire spread rapidly, eventually destroying the entire house.   The family is now left without a home and is hoping to receive help from the community.
